    "Owned private state directory0700, atomic state0600, exclusive lock, schema/identity checks, state16384byte and Docker response65536character caps. Credential never in argv or GITHUB_ENV; only test child receives owned DSNs; captured output password scrubbed before emission.",
    "Run performs daemon/identity/health/mount/port checks and never creates/restarts/removes a service; forces child SEAM_STRICT_NO_SKIP=1 even with inherited0.",
    "Stop verifies labels/name/image/ID before exact rm --force --volumes; verifies removal and empty ownership filter before deleting private state; missing never-started state requires no daemon. Mismatched ownership fails without deletion."
